{"seq":4,"slug":"text-encoding","title":"文本编码","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/regex-text-processing/text-processing-tools/text-encoding","wordCount":975,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"文本编码\">文本编码</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>字符编码是把人类可读字符映射到字节序列的规则体系，而正则匹配最终作用于字节（或码元）——编码不一致会让一个在 UTF-8 上正常的正则完全失效。理解编码是文本处理正确性的前提。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>主流编码：ASCII、Latin-1、UTF-8（变长 1-4 字节、兼容 ASCII）、UTF-16、GB18030，UTF-8 是当今事实标准。</li>\n<li>JavaScript 的 <code>u</code> 标志让正则按 Unicode 码点而非 UTF-16 码元处理字符，正确处理 emoji 与 CJK。</li>\n<li>处理外部文本的标准流程：检测编码 → 转为 UTF-8 → 去除 BOM → Unicode 规范化 → 正则匹配。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"字符编码基础\">字符编码基础</h2><p>字符编码是将人类可读的字符映射到计算机可存储的字节序列的规则体系。正则表达式的正确性高度依赖对文本编码的理解——一个在 UTF-8 文件上正常工作的正则，在 Latin-1 编码的文件上可能完全失效。</p>\n<h3 id=\"代码示例\">代码示例</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"const encoder = new TextEncoder();&#10;encoder.encode(&#39;A&#39;);&#10;encoder.encode(&#39;中&#39;);&#10;encoder.encode(&#39;😀&#39;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> encoder</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TextEncoder</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">encoder.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">encode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'A'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">encoder.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">encode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'中'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">encoder.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">encode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'😀'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"速查表\">速查表</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>编码</th>\n<th>年代</th>\n<th>字节数</th>\n<th>字符范围</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>ASCII</td>\n<td>1963</td>\n<td>1 字节</td>\n<td>128 个字符</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Latin-1</td>\n<td>1987</td>\n<td>1 字节</td>\n<td>256 个字符</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>UTF-8</td>\n<td>1993</td>\n<td>1-4 字节</td>\n<td>全部 Unicode</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>UTF-16</td>\n<td>1996</td>\n<td>2-4 字节</td>\n<td>全部 Unicode</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>UTF-32</td>\n<td>2003</td>\n<td>4 字节</td>\n<td>全部 Unicode</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GB18030</td>\n<td>2000</td>\n<td>1-4 字节</td>\n<td>全部 Unicode + CJK</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"图示\">图示</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    CHAR[&quot;字符 &#39;中&#39;&quot;] --&gt; UNICODE[&quot;Unicode 码点&lt;br/&gt;U+4E2D&quot;]&#10;    UNICODE --&gt; UTF8[&quot;UTF-8&lt;br/&gt;E4 B8 AD (3字节)&quot;]&#10;    UNICODE --&gt; UTF16[&quot;UTF-16&lt;br/&gt;4E 2D (2字节)&quot;]&#10;    UNICODE --&gt; UTF32[&quot;UTF-32&lt;br/&gt;00 00 4E 2D (4字节)&quot;]&#10;    UNICODE --&gt; GB[&quot;GB18030&lt;br/&gt;D6 D0 (2字节)&quot;]\">graph TD\n    CHAR[\"字符 '中'\"] --&gt; UNICODE[\"Unicode 码点&lt;br/&gt;U+4E2D\"]\n    UNICODE --&gt; UTF8[\"UTF-8&lt;br/&gt;E4 B8 AD (3字节)\"]\n    UNICODE --&gt; UTF16[\"UTF-16&lt;br/&gt;4E 2D (2字节)\"]\n    UNICODE --&gt; UTF32[\"UTF-32&lt;br/&gt;00 00 4E 2D (4字节)\"]\n    UNICODE --&gt; GB[\"GB18030&lt;br/&gt;D6 D0 (2字节)\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"utf-8-编码详解\">UTF-8 编码详解</h2><p>UTF-8 是互联网上最广泛使用的字符编码，也是大多数命令行工具和编程语言的默认编码。它的变长编码设计兼容 ASCII 且空间高效。</p>\n<h3 id=\"代码示例\">代码示例</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"function utf8Bytes(char) {&#10;  const encoded = new TextEncoder().encode(char);&#10;  return Array.from(encoded).map((b) =&gt; b.toString(16).padStart(2, &#39;0&#39;));&#10;}&#10;&#10;utf8Bytes(&#39;A&#39;);&#10;utf8Bytes(&#39;é&#39;);&#10;utf8Bytes(&#39;中&#39;);&#10;utf8Bytes(&#39;😀&#39;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> utf8Bytes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">char</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> encoded</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TextEncoder</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">encode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(char);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Array.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(encoded).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> b.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toString</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">padStart</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'0'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">utf8Bytes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'A'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">utf8Bytes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'é'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">utf8Bytes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'中'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">utf8Bytes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'😀'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>UTF-8 编码规则：</p>\n<h3 id=\"速查表\">速查表</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>码点范围</th>\n<th>字节数</th>\n<th>编码格式</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>U+0000 – U+007F</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td><code>0xxxxxxx</code></td>\n<td>A → 41</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>U+0080 – U+07FF</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td><code>110xxxxx 10xxxxxx</code></td>\n<td>é → C3 A9</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>U+0800 – U+FFFF</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td><code>1110xxxx 10xxxxxx 10xxxxxx</code></td>\n<td>中 → E4 B8 AD</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>U+10000 – U+10FFFF</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td><code>11110xxx 10xxxxxx 10xxxxxx 10xxxxxx</code></td>\n<td>😀 → F0 9F 98 80</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"图示\">图示</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph &quot;UTF-8 编码 &#39;中&#39; (U+4E2D)&quot;&#10;        CP[&quot;码点: 0100 1110 0010 1101&quot;]&#10;        CP --&gt; B1[&quot;1110 0100&quot;]&#10;        CP --&gt; B2[&quot;1011 1000&quot;]&#10;        CP --&gt; B3[&quot;1010 1101&quot;]&#10;        B1 --&gt; H1[&quot;E4&quot;]&#10;        B2 --&gt; H2[&quot;B8&quot;]&#10;        B3 --&gt; H3[&quot;AD&quot;]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph \"UTF-8 编码 '中' (U+4E2D)\"\n        CP[\"码点: 0100 1110 0010 1101\"]\n        CP --&gt; B1[\"1110 0100\"]\n        CP --&gt; B2[\"1011 1000\"]\n        CP --&gt; B3[\"1010 1101\"]\n        B1 --&gt; H1[\"E4\"]\n        B2 --&gt; H2[\"B8\"]\n        B3 --&gt; H3[\"AD\"]\n    end</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>提示：</strong> UTF-8 的一个关键特性是<strong>自同步</strong>：从任意字节开始，都可以确定当前字节是字符的首字节还是续字节。首字节以 <code>0</code>、<code>110</code>、<code>1110</code> 或 <code>11110</code> 开头，续字节以 <code>10</code> 开头。这使得 UTF-8 对传输错误具有良好的鲁棒性。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"编码检测与转换\">编码检测与转换</h2><p>在处理来源不明的文本文件时，编码检测和转换是常见的预处理步骤。</p>\n<h3 id=\"代码示例\">代码示例</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"file -I document.txt&#10;&#10;chardet document.txt&#10;&#10;iconv -f GBK -t UTF-8 chinese.txt &gt; chinese_utf8.txt&#10;&#10;iconv -f UTF-8 -t ASCII//TRANSLIT fancy.txt\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">file</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -I</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> document.txt</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">chardet</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> document.txt</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">iconv</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> GBK</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -t</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> UTF-8</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> chinese.txt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> chinese_utf8.txt</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">iconv</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> UTF-8</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -t</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ASCII//TRANSLIT</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> fancy.txt</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"速查表\">速查表</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>功能</th>\n<th>平台</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>file -I</code></td>\n<td>检测文件编码</td>\n<td>macOS/Linux</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>chardet</code></td>\n<td>Python 编码检测</td>\n<td>跨平台</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>iconv</code></td>\n<td>编码转换</td>\n<td>macOS/Linux</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>uconv</code></td>\n<td>ICU 编码转换</td>\n<td>跨平台</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>nkf</code></td>\n<td>日文编码转换</td>\n<td>macOS/Linux</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"const decoder = new TextDecoder(&#39;gbk&#39;);&#10;const buffer = new Uint8Array([0xc4, 0xe3, 0xba, 0xc3]);&#10;decoder.decode(buffer);&#10;&#10;const utf8Decoder = new TextDecoder(&#39;utf-8&#39;, { fatal: true });&#10;try {&#10;  utf8Decoder.decode(new Uint8Array([0xff, 0xfe]));&#10;} catch (e) {&#10;  console.error(&#39;Invalid UTF-8&#39;);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> decoder</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TextDecoder</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'gbk'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> buffer</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Uint8Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0xc4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0xe3</span><span style=\"color:#24